<title>JAPAN: Japan end-April beef stocks fall 14.2% - industry body. [CORRECTED 07:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Japan end-April beef stocks fall 14.2% - industry body. [CORRECTED 07:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects in headline and first paragraph from up 9.4 percent. Industry body corrected calculation of percentage change from the year-ago period.)</p>
<p>Japan's beef stocks reached 96,955 tonnes as of the end of April, down 14.2 percent from a year earlier, the Agriculture and Livestock Industries Corp said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Month	Apr 97     Mar 97     Apr 96     Apr 97/Apr 96</p>
<p> Total	96,955     83,630     112,957     -14.2 pct</p>
<p> Domestic   11,664     10,961	12,440     - 6.2 pct</p>
<p> Imported   85,291     72,669     100,517     -15.1 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
</text>
